# This file keeps the data/ folder tracked by Git
# even though its raw/ and processed/ contents are excluded.
#
# The SmartHire pipeline automatically downloads and creates:
#   data/raw/raw_train.parquet
#   data/raw/raw_test.parquet
#   data/processed/clean_train.parquet
#   data/processed/clean_test.parquet
#
# To regenerate, run:  python main.py
